OL,3,GNEWSABrighton changes traditional blue
OL,4,Apaint to save cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe distinctive shade of turquoise that
OL,7,Fis used for Brighton's seafront
OL,8,Frailings has been changed to a
OL,9,Fdifferent shade to save money.
OL,11,FThe original aquamarine colour, known
OL,12,Fas Brighton Blue, has been used in the
OL,13,Fcity for more than 100 years ` but
OL,14,FBrighton & Hove City Council (BHCC) has
OL,15,Fopted for a similar shade known as RAL
OL,16,Flight green.
OL,18,FSome people are concerned by the
OL,19,Fchange, stating that the original
OL,20,Fcolour is part of Brighton's heritage
OL,21,Fand brand.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
