OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABrighton changes traditional blue
OL,4,Apaint to save cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FBHCC says it is using a specialist
OL,7,Flong-lasting paint to protect the cast
OL,8,Fironwork which is the closest available
OL,9,Fmatch to the original oil-based paint,
OL,10,Fand that it has a duty "to make every
OL,11,Fpound stretch as far as it can".
